0,Kalanadi language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalanadi_language,Kalanadi (IPA: [kɐlɐnaɖi]) is a Southern Dravidian language of India. It is most similar to Pathiya with which it shares 88% lexical similarity.,Kalanadi,Dravidian
